						<riskdesc>Low (Medium)</riskdesc>
						<confidencedesc>Medium</confidencedesc>
						<desc>&lt;p&gt;Cross-Origin-Opener-Policy header is a response header that allows a site to control if others included documents share the same browsing context. Sharing the same browsing context with untrusted documents might lead to data leak.&lt;/p&gt;</desc>
